            "review_title": "Review at Tiki Lounge & Stay",
            "review_text": "Jo L\nStroud District, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nTop host, location, food and drinks.\nFeb 2026 • Family\nThis was a great \"secret\" find while we stayed locally in Ha Long. We wished we had stayed here too! Host, location, service, vibe, food and drink are spot on the mark. We could not fault it in any way and the particular area was, for us great and looking out over the bay, as per Internet blogs etc - quieter and away from the more tourist area over the bridge in the centre of Ha Long.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 27, 2026\nSergio\nThank you for such an amazing review — we truly appreciate it.\n\nLooks like you found one of Ha Long’s best kept “secrets” 😉\nWe’re glad you enjoyed the vibe, the view, and everything in between.\n\nNext time, don’t just visit us… stay with us 😄\n\nSee you again soon!\n\n— Tiki Lounge & Stay 🍹\nRead more\nWritten March 29, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
